# Build and measurement artefacts of the throwaway stack spikes (see README.md).
# This whole directory is deleted from main once harness part 1 is green (wk 5);
# the `spike-end` tag keeps it readable.

# Cargo
target/
**/target/
Cargo.lock
# …except each spike's own lock file: the cross-OS comparison is only a controlled
# experiment when all three runners resolve the same dependency graph (--locked).
!*/Cargo.lock

# Godot 4.7 (g1-remesh/godot/) — import cache, regenerated on open
.godot/
*.import
*.translation
export_presets.cfg

# gdext / native output
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.pdb
*.exp
*.lib

# Measurement artefacts: summarise them into the plan's Results section, then
# let them go. Force-add (git add -f) only a minimal excerpt that documents a
# finding, e.g. the first differing lines of a cross-OS hash trace.
*.csv
*.json
*.png
trace*.txt
snapshots-*.txt
paths*.txt
bench*.txt
results/
